5,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. I'm looking forward to working with you all on this. To start, I think it's important to understand how we handle crises and how our plans evolve. I'll be focusing on those areas.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree that stability is key. I want to ensure any new system can actually handle our physical environment and the reality of our peak seasons. I'll be looking into the practical side of operations.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'm ready to make this interesting! I want to see if we're just patching old holes or actually improving. I'll be digging into the upgrade history of the dispatch tool and the data lift in the 2018 pay move.,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I believe we need to consider the human element of this transition. I will look into administrator retirements and hiring times, as well as depot supervisors and the last rollout.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to be here. To ensure we aren't blindsided by hidden costs or creative accounting, I shall examine the board minutes on capital and operating requests and five years of renewal invoices.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I think we have a good spread of perspectives. To be more specific about my choices, I'll look into support ownership during last winter's outage and warehouse rule changes after new accounts.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"To be precise, I will examine the depot calendar and the peak-season cutover, as well as the yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial. We cannot afford a system that fails on the floor.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,I think we've all laid our cards on the table quite clearly. I'm curious to see if the patterns I suspect are actually there. I'll stick with my choices and wait for the results!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I agree. I believe understanding the current staffing pressures and how previous rollouts affected the supervisors will give us a clearer picture of our actual capacity for change. I will wait for the findings.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, the distribution of our focus is quite comprehensive. I shall await the findings with a measured amount of anticipation, hoping the numbers tell a story that is as honest as our intentions.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm glad we're all on the same page. Since we've all specified our areas of interest, I'm happy to move forward. I'll be waiting to see what the records reveal about our support and planning.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I have no further additions. The current selection of research topics covers the financial, human, and operational risks sufficiently. I will wait for the data to see if our current infrastructure can actually support a replacement.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I'm feeling a bit impatient now! Let's just get to the good part and see what we find. I'm sure some of these records are going to be quite revealing.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
18,1,3,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I agree. There is no need for further discussion until we have the facts. I will wait for the results of the investigation.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I concur. We have cast a wide net, and it would be a pity to spoil the surprise with premature speculation. I shall see you all once the archives have yielded their secrets.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. Let's move forward and see what we discover. I'm looking forward to hearing everyone's findings in the next round.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
